      "title": "Psalm 23 - (Dwell In Your House)",
      "description": "'Psalm 23' (Dwell In Your House) is the 5th installment in the Jubilee Church 'The Psalms of Summer' worship collective\n\nThese worship songs accompany our 'Psalms of Summer' sermon series. Each song is based on one of the books of Psalms. As David wrote songs to express his love for God and at times, his need for rescue and forgiveness, we also express our need for Him in our lives and we rejoice over what He has done for us!!!\n\nLet this song remind us of God's presence in our lives, His faithfulness, provision, safety and love! \n\nLyrics:\n\nAll my days secure in Your promise\nEvery breath inhaling Your grace\nEvery moment hemmed in Your faithfulness\nAnd today I rest in this\n\nYou prepare a table before me\nIn the presence of my enemies\nSurely goodness and mercy will follow me\nAll my days through heaven’s gates\n\nI will dwell in Your house Lord forever\nI will dwell in Your house Lord forever\nWhere wanting will cease\nAnd my joy is complete\nI will dwell in Your house Oh Lord\n\nThough I walk through valleys of shadows\nI will fear no evil around\nYou are near Your kindness restores my soul\nYou will lead me to rivers of peace\n\nIn Your presence\nMy cup overflows\nIn Your presence\nMy soul will rejoice\nYour life-giving presence\nIs right where I want to stay\nFor all my days",
